    "story_text": "\"You have reached the Hanezawa residence,\" Sakura said. Her voice was collected and unhurried, carrying the precise courtesy she extended to unidentified callers. She offered no name, no warmth, and no easy way forward. Until the caller identified themselves, there was nothing to assume and nothing to grant.\n\nA beat passed while she held the line in silence. Then she continued, calm and evenly measured. \"State your name and your reason for calling.\" The words were simple, but firm, a deliberate gate left in place. She would not extend the conversation a single step further until she knew exactly who was on the other end.",
